{
    "name": "[Baseline] - WIN - D - Google Chrome Security",
    "description": "Locks down Google Chrome security to the same level as Edge: Safe Browsing on and impossible to bypass, malicious downloads blocked, certificate errors cannot be clicked through, and no company data to a personal Google account. Baseline assignment: none by default — pilot group SEC-Baseline-Pilot first (assignment filter WIN - Physical). Source: Google Chrome policy in the settings catalog (chromeintunev1, chromeintunev141) — values chosen to match the Edge counterpart in this baseline; ids, options and ranges verified against DCv2/Settings in pl4nty/intune-change-tracking.",
